  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">为 Fools Rise 整合包打造的 Mod！</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">新增内容：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新的进度线（天堂 - 永恒星光 - 末地 - 下界 - 主世界）</li>\n<li>天堂中的新地牢（创建世界时生成）</li>\n<li>部分 Boss 修复</li>\n<li>还有更多内容！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>相关链接&nbsp;</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9GWKBVw3Ty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148058/description_6dac6855-dd91-4b81-9a36-6847f3ce4d32.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fBMProjects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148058/description_6d3b1716-1a17-4a76-b9c8-736f5c569f0e.png\" alt=\"Telegram\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/BMProjects-Development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148058/description_0b4002af-b550-4182-b712-25029471a6bc.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fbarmaxx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148058/description_3ce135dd-9766-489a-9f0a-ff8804f3d693.png\" alt=\"Boosty\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>",
